# Networking Task

Task: Set the MTU of the network interface `{{nic}}` to `{{mtu}}` bytes.

- The interface `{{nic}}` must be up with the requested MTU active.
- Persist the setting in a new dedicated configuration file; do not overwrite or delete any existing network configuration files.
- Do not modify the configuration of any other network interface, and do not change the system default route.
- The configuration must persist across reboots.
